| `createPublicPricingSectionSEOSchema` | `$lib/content/utils/createPublicPricingSEOSchema.ts` | `WebPage` (`#pricing`) with paid + self-host `Offer` list or `{}` |
| `createHowToSEOSchema` | `$lib/seo/createHowToSEOSchema.ts` | Low-level `HowTo` + `HowToStep` builder (docs, blog, setup steps) |
| `createDocsPageSeoSchema` | `$lib/docs/utils/seo/docsSeoSchema.ts` | `JsonLdGraphSchema` (`TechArticle`, breadcrumbs, images, optional `HowTo` from `<Steps>`) |
| `createSoftwareSourceCodeNodes` | `$lib/seo/softwareSourceCodeNodes.ts` | `SoftwareSourceCode[]` from markdown/OpenAPI code blocks (`isPartOf` → parent article) |
| `buildDocsPageLoadExtras` | `$lib/docs/utils/seo/buildDocsPageLoadExtras.ts` | `howToBlocks`, `docImages`, `codeBlocks` (raw fences + optional OpenAPI client samples when `meta.openapi` fetch succeeds) |
| `createLandingDemoSEOSchema` | `$lib/content/utils/createLandingDemoSEOSchema.ts` | `VideoObject` or `{}` |
| `createOrganizationSEOSchema` | `$lib/content/utils/createOrganizationSEOSchema.ts` | `Organization` |
| `createBlogPostSEOSchema` | `$lib/blogs/utils/blogSeoSchema.ts` | `JsonLdGraphSchema` |
| Blog hub builders | `$lib/blogs/utils/blogSeoSchema.ts` | `Blog`, `CollectionPage`, `ItemList`, `ProfilePage`, `BreadcrumbList` for `/blog`, `/blog/topic`, `/blog/author` |
| `createPostSEOSchema` | `$lib/posts/utils/createPostSEOSchema.ts` | `JsonLdGraphSchema` |
| `createListingSEOSchema` | `$lib/listings/utils/listingSchema.ts` | `JsonLdGraphSchema` |
